{"id": "DfPPLexRru4", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Shehar ki laakh dawaiyaan ek kandha theek na kar paayi. Akhade ki maati ne kar diya 🤎\n\nGaon ka pehlwan Bittu shehar ki academy aaya: neeli chamakti matt, sheeshe, protein ke dabbe. Har bout mein patka gaya, har baar uth ke phir khada hua.\nPhir kandha jawab de gaya. Spray, tape, barf, goliyan: kuch kaam na aaya.\nWoh akhade laut aaya. Ustad ne laal maati mein sarson ka tel aur haldi milayi aur kandhe pe rakh di.\nAgle hi daanv mein boodhe Ustad ne use patak diya, aur woh maati mein pada hasta raha.\n\n🎵 Maati · @farakmaybe @ansh4sure @bhaktaaa  @akshatjakhar @mcsquare7000 · Hustle 5 (Apna Homeground)\n\nSend this to the pehlwan who left the akhada for the city 🤍\n\nMaati | MC Square | Farak | Ansh4sure | Bhaktaaa | Akshat Jakhar | Hustle 5 | Haryanvi rap | akhada | kushti | pehlwan | gaon ki mitti\n\n#Maati #Hustle5 #Akhada", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793620238, "like_count": 5451, "comment_count": 30, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1787385232372109a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.369, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMHNUnYxvyoW9Iq3w8cT5e5ITF6YKOmg2vTMCguhwCmRYEnJU-Cd0HF7IM19ADVBYVAE_WTEde64kYq_5X0E3IlVt2zQfRA47SueGk.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Adq4iawD0eY7wcdq6DJGuX8XzpvXWgCNrzSmUPCAMhwvYQUG1rG1ARXm2ZTqFv6dF1bKrCiCsvPfcBa3TGDwzpg4&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=iZxE0Lc_7RoQ7kNvwFjT5e9&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=sAP7jfQB9yKj4ESqn4pw9g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=ur